                  "text": "Recipient of the Q2, FY22 Individual award in the Growth Catalyst Award category for almost US$ 20 million originated, Prachi established herself as a trusted advisor to various stakeholders across North America and Europe. She gained significant experience in target outreach decks and proficient in reviewing deliverables from other team members. Her work with the FS Technology Lead for UKI, has helped the team become recognized for origination activities, resulting in three additional account requests for recognition. Additionally, Prachi initiated a project on Metaverse, educating the team on the emerging technology. Also led efforts to revamp SMART+, the operations management tool for the Sales & Origination Team."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
